**/__pycache__/
.DS_Store
.coverage
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
docs/_build/
docs/public/_build/
docs/_build/
_*/

# Underscore-prefixed dirs above are scratch/build artifacts, but the
# ``_internal`` package is real, importable source and must be tracked/packaged.
# Re-include only its Python sources (keep __pycache__ etc. ignored).
!source/ovannotators/_internal/
!source/ovannotators/_internal/*.py

# Sphinx static assets live under an underscore-prefixed dir but are real
# source (e.g. docs media embedded in the tutorials) and must be tracked.
!docs/public/_static/
!docs/public/_static/**

# Cloned reference repos (NVIDIA Cosmos / Cosmos Framework) for transfer integration
external/

# Ignore warp cache
.warpcache/
